# start
// Add any `~type` to augment the activity with an icon.
// There are two kinds of these icons, and you can
// combine them (`~multiple`, `~adhoc`, `~loop`).
- send ~send
- receive ~receive
- manual ~manual
- user ~user
- script ~script ~multiple
- service ~service ~adhoc
- businessrule ~businessrule ~loop
. end

[place @manual below @start]
[place @service below @manual]
